      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing OCR Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Vision AI for OCR. I will now integrate its API into the `extract_text.py` file to handle text extraction. This provides a robust solution, which I think will serve the purpose. The next step is getting familiar with the Vision API implementation.\n\n\n**Implementing OCR Functionality**\n\nI'm now fully committed to integrating Google Cloud Vision AI into `extract_text.py`. The plan is to have the Python script handle OCR using the Google Cloud Vision API. I'll need to include the proper imports and client initialization to make this integration seamless.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860603881,
          "start": 1789860602172
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc01613c001qZkHn8TT4qJ7LE",
